[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5343.27, "timestamp": "01:29:03", "text": "角色扮演游戏类型？我更喜欢……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5346.95, "timestamp": "01:29:06", "text": "故事模式。故事，故事。是的。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5351.11, "timestamp": "01:29:11", "text": "不是原神，只是……一个很长的故事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5353.27, "timestamp": "01:29:13", "text": "游戏，伙计。我以前玩过原神"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5354.709, "timestamp": "01:29:14", "text": "两年后我就觉得无聊了，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5357.75, "timestamp": "01:29:17", "text": "它有着庞大的故事情节。是的。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5359.91, "timestamp": "01:29:19", "text": "这几乎和之前的情况一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5361.37, "timestamp": "01:29:21", "text": "一遍又一遍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5364.39, "timestamp": "01:29:24", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5365.39, "timestamp": "01:29:25", "text": "它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5374.629, "timestamp": "01:29:34", "text": "我喜欢像《古墓丽影》这样的游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5377.43, "timestamp": "01:29:37", "text": "东西。哦，《古墓丽影》真是太棒了。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5379.99, "timestamp": "01:29:39", "text": "着火了。冒险类游戏。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5383.35, "timestamp": "01:29:43", "text": "我完了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5385.99, "timestamp": "01:29:45", "text": "是啊，冒险游戏真的很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5391.59, "timestamp": "01:29:51", "text": "是的。你可以记录很多东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5394.79, "timestamp": "01:29:54", "text": "我想玩很多游戏，但是电脑游戏不行。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5395.875, "timestamp": "01:29:55", "author": "@Firefly__2671", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/3WZYI-EaghtDDKgYu2t7zJHTwPSRX4W_D7oxSVjCm4N7mgl2eaFHhiCQLgRHmcsbmXBdMscg6w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i playing tomb raider rn btw"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5399.669, "timestamp": "01:29:59", "text": "Jama 说：不，我太……呃，是的，GPU"}]